WEBVTT

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:36.000
Please don't get in my way!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.450
Are you all right with
this city being so dirty?!

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.000
You're just terrible!

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:54.290
Now I have to clean everything up again!

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:13.290
After him.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.700
I know.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.160
Hey, miss!

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:55.750
It's dangerous walking
around here all by yourself!

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:09.540
Thank you, Officer.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.750
You went through the trouble
of crossing the bridge.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.410
I was summoned to headquarters.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:18.200
I know who the culprit was.

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:21.370
Leave it to us!

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:23.200
The police are no good.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:26.040
You know that well yourself.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:29.120
There is no one you can depend on.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.120
I will avenge my father myself.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.450
What are you planning to do?

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:37.580
I'm talking about our true enemy.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.580
The <i>unseen council</i> .

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.910
Hey, Belo!

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.790
He's always nearby. Always.

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:11.330
Then he should just come over and join us.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.450
I wonder what happened to him.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.660
He should just tell us.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.290
We should go ask.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.250
It's hard to ask.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:22.950
He's giving off a vibe that
he doesn't want to be bothered.

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:26.410
Belo is always saving us.

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:28.290
Are you guys really his friends?

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:31.200
Then, what about you, Maaya?

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:33.750
I'm a little scared.

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.250
But I'm lonely, too.

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.790
It's boring without Belo.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:51.620
We would have never known
without your report, Summers.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:56.290
Chief. Weren't you a little
slovenly about reporting in?

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:59.870
I apologize for the delayed decision.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:07.250
Summers was the only one who saw
the monster, so it took time to confirm.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:13.330
I know Summers better than you do.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:16.120
I was the one who sent her Outside

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:18.250
in the first place.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:21.700
I did it in order to protect her.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:24.000
Yes, I know.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:29.700
We know that there are more
mysterious cases in Outside than Upper.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:35.660
Though, to think a creature
like this was reported.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:39.410
I believe you saw what you say you saw.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:47.330
After some discussion, we have taken
the word "monstrosity" into consideration

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:56.620
and have decided to call all
humanoid variants, humanoid monsters.

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.620
Humanoid monsters?

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:02.950
It has such a foreign ring to it...

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:05.080
You'll get used to it soon.

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:07.790
Our superiors have taken a liking to the term.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:08.700
I see.

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:15.910
On top of that, the monsters that
can disguise themselves as human...

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.290
Alpha.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.370
Beta.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.160
Gamma.

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:26.620
They have been specially named.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.660
About those three...

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:32.620
Yes, you're the only one who has
come in contact with them many times.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.080
I'd like to hear your opinion.

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:38.000
There is a chance they are our allies.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:41.790
Allies? Those monsters?

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:46.700
I felt that it was a possibility
from our last encounter.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:53.830
Also, when Alpha was in human form,
he once saved me from danger.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.330
You never told us this before.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.330
No one would believe me, anyway.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:06.750
We'll soon know if they are
our enemies or allies.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:10.790
The 18th precinct is to
capture these creatures.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:13.040
Capture?!

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:16.370
An operational commander
will oversee this assignment.

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:18.370
Come in.

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.200
Introduce yourself.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:31.750
Head operative of special 1st division, Felt.

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:33.950
I will take care of things from here.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.410
Hello, I am the 18th precinct--

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.620
Unnecessary introductions.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.000
Take me to the site.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.620
P-Please wait, let me report the situation.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.200
I am already aware.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:45.790
Of course you are...

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.450
Sonia.

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:49.700
Don't act alone too much.

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:53.160
You haven't changed at all.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:56.620
You've completely embarrassed your chief.

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:59.160
If there is a need for action,

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.700
I take action.

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:05.750
If you overdo it, there will be
nowhere left for you to go.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:09.950
Chief of Headquarters, you are
singing quite a different tune.

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:16.500
Don't say that. I was actually
pretty happy that you turned to me.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:21.160
Though, I am amazed at myself
for even depending on you.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.750
You lost him?

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:33.160
Though I was able to chase him pretty far.

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:34.700
I see.

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:37.450
What do you think is this new idiot's aim?

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:40.200
He said he was cleaning up.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:05.250
This is a mansion of trash...

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:09.250
Please make me a proper vacuum cleaner!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.040
Hoh. A vacuum cleaner.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:13.750
How admirable.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.120
You want to clean things up that badly?

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:20.200
It feels good when things are cleaned up.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:26.910
I want to sweep up every
single corner of this city.

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:30.040
That's why I joined the sanitation department.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:35.620
I wanted to make this area, that Upper
called a trash dump, sparkling clean.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:46.120
Why is everyone okay with
this place being so dirty?

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.660
My parent was a person who
couldn't pick up after herself.

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:53.330
I didn't have a father.

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:58.450
Every time my mother came home,
she brought a different man.

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:01.700
They would always be so violent to me.

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.540
My mother never stopped them.

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:08.450
Since those people were usually
never home, I was always alone.

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:15.620
I didn't have much to do, so I started
cleaning up that messy room.

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:19.790
A clean room felt so nice...

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:21.500
That's why...

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:30.790
I cleaned up my mother and that man, too.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:34.290
It felt so refreshing.

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:38.370
So, in other words, you want to clean
things up and make yourself feel good.

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:41.700
Dirty people are trash.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:46.250
I do not quite understand your feelings...

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:49.660
It's fine. I've realized it now.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:51.500
If I don't clean up the people,

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:54.040
the world will never be clean.

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:57.120
Quite a unique way of thinking.

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:01.250
Yes! It has to be me.

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:03.750
I wish I was born as a vacuum cleaner.

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.410
You can become one.

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:06.620
Really?!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:12.870
There is a technique I had been
wanting to try. I'm sure you will like it.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:25.290
This will be quite an interesting sample.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:50.500
What is it?

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:51.540
Nothing.

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:58.830
What the hell is this?!

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:03.290
This morning, some workers
came by and did this.

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:09.830
Starting today, this room is the front
line of the humanoid monster capture.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:13.080
Um, where will my room be?

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.500
Do you need one?

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:17.620
Where is Officer Summers?

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.870
Where are you going?

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:26.000
The Helmsmen got some information
on the humanoid monsters.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:28.040
Humanoid monsters?

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:30.450
That is what those monsters are called.

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:33.620
It seems the higher-ups in Upper
gave them the name.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:37.750
Higher-ups? The boss of that Felt guy?

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.450
That person is from the special division.

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:40.540
Special division?!

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:43.250
He is a minion of the unseen council.

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:47.120
So, the people of Upper ordered this?

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.660
I do not know.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:51.950
For now, I need to confirm this lead.

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:54.790
Then, you should report this
to the special officer.

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:57.750
He will not take the Helmsmen seriously.

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:05.200
As expected of the Upper's Jeanne d'Arc.

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.870
She knows the special division well.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.080
Oh, he looked just like this man.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:24.080
You've seen them with
the other two before, as well?

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.700
Every now and then.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:31.660
This man, a young girl, and an
even younger boy. Three of 'em.

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:44.870
You trash!

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.750
The suction power isn't dropping!

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.410
Help!

00:15:08.870 --> 00:15:11.580
You shouldn't get things dirty.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.080
I will not accept mobilization.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:23.200
But a humanoid monster is
running rampant in our district!

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:26.080
We have gotten many reports
from the citizens as well!

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:28.870
It is not my target for capture.

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:41.200
I understand. I will head to the scene.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.200
The special officer isn't making a move?

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:45.700
It's not the Alpha, so he says
he's not going to do anything.

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:49.080
You get the short end of the stick
since you're already out.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:52.540
Why?! He's only set on his objective.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:05.290
Trash! There's more trash!

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:26.580
He has appeared! It's Alpha!

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.120
We will head there immediately.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.580
Make sure to report every last detail.

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.160
Um, where are you going?

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:42.200
What enjoyment does
that guy get out of life?

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:44.370
You again!

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:47.160
Please don't get in my way any longer!

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:57.160
I can't suck them up! I can't suck them!

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.790
With a body like that, you won't
be able to return to your human form.

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:04.700
That's fine! If I can clean things up,
I don't need to be human!

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:07.450
I don't need humans! They are trash!

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:09.540
I don't believe that.

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:18.700
You're trash, too!

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:21.910
Trash! Trash! Trash!

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:24.450
Trash!

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:37.540
What are you? Gross!

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:40.790
I've never seen anything so ugly!

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:44.200
You trash! You trash! You trash!

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:54.040
I feel so much better now!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:17.200
Rethink your life.

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:20.950
Don't toss your humanity aside.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.250
You shouldn't go there right now.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.660
You'll just get hurt again.

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:40.700
See?

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:43.660
But it seems different from before.

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:50.370
I am lucky.

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:56.540
Right after my assignment, I was
able to confirm a humanoid monster.

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:57.660
Do it.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:00.200
Beta?

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:06.660
Gamma?!

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:28.080
Eliminate it.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.450
There is no need for trash.

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:45.080
Please wait.

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:50.370
Officer Summers. Excellent notification.

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:53.120
However, I do not approve of your method.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:59.290
Alpha saved me. It protected you, as well.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:01.330
Unnecessary information.

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:03.330
My assignment is their capture.

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:05.250
That is my job.

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:07.830
Then, what was the meaning
of shooting him to death?

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:13.790
We should have gotten information
from him as a suspect in this incident.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.160
That is trash.

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:26.580
That person looked happy.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:27.790
Huh?

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:31.250
I wonder if that is what happiness is.

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:32.950
What are you talking about?

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:38.250
He was able to become what he wanted
to become. That's why he was so happy.

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:41.120
He was happily sucking up humans.

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:44.450
I don't know.

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:48.370
How can humans toss away
their humanity so easily?

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:52.620
Do we really want to become like them?

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:09.540
I was waiting for you.

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:12.450
You were so close.

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:16.040
Hurry and come to my side.

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:24.500
I want you, Bem.
